# ChipSim data tree — build-plan S7.
#
# ChipSim never redistributes DrugBank. The snapshot lands under data/raw/,
# is DVC-tracked, and is git-ignored. What MUST stay tracked is everything that
# makes the snapshot *recoverable and auditable*: the .dvc pointers, the
# .gitkeep anchors, and the processed-artifact digests (defect 10c).

data/raw/*
data/interim/*
data/processed/*

!*.dvc
!.gitkeep
!data/processed/*.sha256
